# LeakSanitizer suppressions for guitest only.
# KMessageBox's default Notify option hands the message text to KDE's notification
# integration, which is delivered from a later event loop and still alive when the test
# process exits. Shown by removing the Notify option: the leak disappears. Not
# Anchorage's memory; the app keeps the normal KDE behaviour.
leak:KMessageBox::createKMessageBox
